    "en": {
      "trackName": "LUKY Puzzle",
      "description": "Master color arrangement in this elegant puzzle game!\nNow you can play on your Apple Watch, too — swipe to slide cubes, double-tap to teleport the red one.\n\nGAMEPLAY\n• Slide colored tiles into position on the grid\n• Arrange each color to form a complete row or column\n• Use the red teleporter tile — it can jump anywhere!\n• Solve in fewer moves to earn more stars\n\nFEATURES\n• 6 unique levels with increasing complexity\n• Grids from 4×3 up to 7×5\n• 9 vibrant colors to organize\n• Star rating system and move tracking\n• Smooth animations and haptic feedback\n• Clean, minimalist design\n\nPERFECT FOR\n• Puzzle enthusiasts and logic game fans\n• Quick brain training sessions\n• Anyone seeking a polished puzzle experience\n\nStart free, then unlock 5 premium levels with bigger grids and more colors!",
      "releaseNotes": "NEW: Play LUKY Puzzle on Apple Watch! \n\n• Solve puzzles right from your wrist — the first 4 levels, full-screen\n• Simple controls: swipe to slide a cube, double-tap to teleport the red one\n• Earn stars and track your best moves on Watch\n• Built-in \"How to Play\" guide\n• Premium levels you own on iPhone unlock automatically on Watch",
